# SG-9 (BACKLOG.md): turning slowly within 40 of a guard page's side. Booted on 0680 (row 6, column 8)
# facing east, turned right to face south: the guard page at (8, 7) stands against this roof. Walked
# out to column 9 (facing W: +x, out), a quarter turn left to face S (+y: the guard page at (9, 7)),
# into it (you stop WALKER_RADIUS, 40, from its side), then turned all the way round, a shot every
# quarter second. Read fps and "vdp1 over" against a SCREEN_WALL 0 build: facing the wall, the city
# behind it isn't drawn
